== Nicovideo Template Documentation ==

=== Syntax ===
<pre>{{Nicovideo|linkid|description|type}}</pre>

=== Parameters ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Values
|-
| 1. <code>linkid</code>
| The ID of the NicoNico Douga content (required)
| Video ID, user ID, mylist ID, community ID, or channel ID
|-
| 2. <code>description</code>
| A short description or title for the link (optional)
| Any text. If omitted, a default description based on the content type will be used.
|-
| 3. <code>type</code>
| Specifies the type of content (optional)
| 
* <code>video (default)</code>
* <code>user</code>
* <code>mylist</code>
* <code>community (end of service)</code>
* <code>channel</code>
|}

=== Examples ===

1. Default video link:
<pre>{{Nicovideo|sm34159150}}
or
{{Nicovideo|sm34159150|Video Description|video}}</pre>
Output:<br />
{{Nicovideo|sm34159150}}
or
{{Nicovideo|sm34159150|Wolpis Carter's Cosmos|video}}

2. User page with description:
<pre>{{Nicovideo|1796335|Soraru's Page|user}}</pre>
Output: {{Nicovideo|1796335|Soraru's Page|user}}

3. Mylist with description:
<pre>{{Nicovideo|16016171|Amatsuki's Utattemita Collection|mylist}}</pre>
Output:{{Nicovideo|16016171|Amatsuki's Utattemita Collection|mylist}}

4. Community link ([https://blog.nicovideo.jp/niconews/225559.html End of Service Notice]):
<pre>{{Nicovideo|co54321|Our Music Community|community}}</pre>
Output: {{Nicovideo|co54321|Music Community|community}}

5. Channel link with default description:
<pre>{{Nicovideo|alfakyun||channel}}</pre>
Output:{{Nicovideo|alfakyun||channel}}

